  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Grove / HY2.0 4-pin right-angle SMD socket (Megastar ZX-HY2.0-4PWT, LCSC C7429571; the HY2.0-4PWT wafers from other makers share this layout). Signal pads 1.5x3.0 mm at 2.0 mm pitch, two 1.5x3.0 mm anchor pads 10.5 mm apart centred 7.5 mm toward the front (the drawing shows 3.4 mm long pads reaching 9.4 mm; shortened at the front so the pads keep 0.3 mm from a board edge flush with the housing face). Origin is the centre of the pad pattern (midway between the signal row and the anchor pads), which is the reference JLCPCB/EasyEDA use for this part (CONN-SMD_4P-P2.00_ZX-HY2.0-4PWT). Signal row at y -3.85, anchor pads centred at y +3.65. Housing 12 x 7.8 x 5.2 mm, plug opening toward +y, front face 5.45 mm from the origin. Pin 1 is on the -x side when the opening faces +y, as in the JST PH side-entry drawings; on a Grove cable that is the black GND wire.")
  (tags "connector Grove HY2.0 CN105")
